{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "e-act Catcher for Akpala",
    "steam_appid": 2344740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/4b6d5e538281cffff34ed18b60f4b713.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br><br><strong><u>[Important] Notice:</u></strong><br>&quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot; is a special auxiliary software. It cannot be played standalone. Cooperation with players who own the VR game &quot;Akpala&quot; is required.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/8c6d958fbbfe5f369e1a1f0a90275b9d.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>This software invites &quot;Akpala&quot; players and captures their gameplay in VR in real-time. It is the perfect software for video recording and organizing e-sports events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/742c05266eb1bb95a8fbe159a10df222.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>Not only for filming Akpala player's gameplay but also for hosting e-sports events and drama productions. Unleash your creativity to create new entertainment experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/064c6c9cae9167ed8048567399713a40.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>Download and launch &quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot;.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter the matching lobby and generate a room ID.<br></li><li>Share the room ID with users who have &quot;Akpala&quot;.<br></li><li>Once VR players enter the room, start filming or hosting e-sports tournaments, etc.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/d344f4eced35c6b41ab24d6d999ee084.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br><br>A PC version software that captures the VR experience of Akpala from a new angle.<br>Features include communication with players, camera switching, and camera operation during filming.<br>Allows filming of the game from a perspective different than the VR players of &quot;Akpala&quot;.<br>With &quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot;, record the world of Akpala from a new viewpoint!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/4b6d5e538281cffff34ed18b60f4b713.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br><br><strong><u>[Important] Notice:</u></strong><br>&quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot; is a special auxiliary software. It cannot be played standalone. Cooperation with players who own the VR game &quot;Akpala&quot; is required.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/8c6d958fbbfe5f369e1a1f0a90275b9d.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>This software invites &quot;Akpala&quot; players and captures their gameplay in VR in real-time. It is the perfect software for video recording and organizing e-sports events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/742c05266eb1bb95a8fbe159a10df222.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>Not only for filming Akpala player's gameplay but also for hosting e-sports events and drama productions. Unleash your creativity to create new entertainment experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/064c6c9cae9167ed8048567399713a40.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br>Download and launch &quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot;.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter the matching lobby and generate a room ID.<br></li><li>Share the room ID with users who have &quot;Akpala&quot;.<br></li><li>Once VR players enter the room, start filming or hosting e-sports tournaments, etc.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344740/extras/d344f4eced35c6b41ab24d6d999ee084.webp?t=1725967302\" /></span><br><br>A PC version software that captures the VR experience of Akpala from a new angle.<br>Features include communication with players, camera switching, and camera operation during filming.<br>Allows filming of the game from a perspective different than the VR players of &quot;Akpala&quot;.<br>With &quot;e-act Catcher for Akpala&quot;, record the world of Akpala from a new viewpoint!",
    "short_description": "This software, used from a PC, captures 'Akpala' players' VR gameplay in real time. Record battles and stream movie-like videos, thanks to expressive players. It offers up to 12 cameras, including fixed and overhead tracking ones, for innovative broadcasting with e-act Catcher",
